# APPLICATION ROOT INIT: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

> **THE FOUNDATION**: The application root must be strictly typed, enforce theme states early to prevent hydration flashes, and wrap the app in the required React 19 / TanStack providers.

## 1. NEXT.JS (APP ROUTER) ROOT LAYOUT STANDARD
- **Constraint**: Must enforce `suppressHydrationWarning` on `<html>` to allow theme providers to inject classes without React hydration mismatch errors.
- **Typography**: Must inject the primary Sans font (e.g., Inter/Outfit) at the root.

```tsx
// ✅ REQUIRED PATTERN: app/layout.tsx
import { Inter } from 'next/font/google';
import { Providers } from '@/components/Providers';
import { Toaster } from 'sonner';
import './globals.css';

const inter = Inter({ subsets: ['latin'], variable: '--font-inter' });

export const metadata = {
  title: 'Infinity Protocol Sovereign App',
  description: 'Built on v6.2 Liquid Glass Standards.',
};

export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    // suppressHydrationWarning is MANDATORY for next-themes
    <html lang="en" suppressHydrationWarning className={`${inter.variable} font-sans`}>
      <body className="antialiased bg-black text-white selection:bg-white/30">
        <Providers>
          {children}
          {/* Universal Sonner Toaster at Root */}
          <Toaster position="bottom-right" theme="dark" richColors />
        </Providers>
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

## 2. UNIVERSAL PROVIDERS WRAPPER
- **Constraint**: All context providers must be contained in a dedicated Client Component wrapper to keep `layout.tsx` a Server Component.

```tsx
// ✅ REQUIRED PATTERN: components/Providers.tsx
'use client';

import { ThemeProvider } from 'next-themes';
import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from '@tanstack/react-query';
import { useState } from 'react';

export function Providers({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  // Lazy initialize QueryClient to avoid sharing cache across requests
  const [queryClient] = useState(() => new QueryClient({
    defaultOptions: {
      queries: {
        staleTime: 60 * 1000, // 1 minute
        retry: 1,
      },
    },
  }));

  return (
    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
      <ThemeProvider attribute="class" defaultTheme="dark" enableSystem disableTransitionOnChange>
        {children}
      </ThemeProvider>
    </QueryClientProvider>
  );
}
```
